{"book":11,"chapter":27,"rubric":"MODERN FRONTEND / JAVASCRIPT IN THE BROWSER / CHAPTER 19","slides":[{"title":"Working offline","sub":"Chapter 27 · Workers and PWAs","short":"Intro","main":"Workers and service workers are the basis of a PWA.","body":[{"t":"scene","labels":["One thread","Workers and service workers","PWA"],"captions":["So far all code has run on the page's single main thread and depended on the network","Workers move heavy work to separate threads, and a service worker sits between the page and the network","Together they make a progressive web app; in the exercises we model each mechanism"],"frames":[[{"t":"cell","id":"p","x":90.0,"y":70.0,"w":120.0,"h":44.0,"text":"page","tone":"yellow","size":11.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"line","id":"a","x1":152.0,"y1":70.0,"x2":208.0,"y2":70.0,"tone":"green","arrow":true,"width":1.6},{"t":"cell","id":"s","x":280.0,"y":70.0,"w":100.0,"h":44.0,"text":"network","tone":"blue","size":11.0,"sub_size":8.5}],[{"t":"cell","id":"p","x":70.0,"y":40.0,"w":90.0,"h":28.0,"text":"page","tone":"yellow","size":10.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"w","x":70.0,"y":110.0,"w":90.0,"h":28.0,"text":"Worker","tone":"green","size":10.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"sw","x":200.0,"y":75.0,"w":110.0,"h":36.0,"text":"Service Worker","tone":"blue","size":9.5,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"n","x":320.0,"y":75.0,"w":56.0,"h":36.0,"text":"network","tone":"muted","size":10.0,"sub_size":8.5}],[{"t":"cell","id":"t0","x":66.0,"y":70.0,"w":104.0,"h":36.0,"text":"HTTPS","tone":"green","size":10.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"t1","x":180.0,"y":70.0,"w":104.0,"h":36.0,"text":"Service Worker","tone":"green","size":10.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"t2","x":294.0,"y":70.0,"w":104.0,"h":36.0,"text":"manifest","tone":"green","size":10.0,"sub_size":8.5}]],"cues":[11.2,29.4]}]},{"title":"Web Worker","sub":"postMessage and cloning","short":"Worker","main":"Move long work to a separate thread.","body":[{"t":"scene","labels":["Main thread","Worker","Structured cloning"],"captions":["The main thread runs scripts, styles, layout and paint: a long computation freezes the UI","A Web Worker is a separate thread with its own event queue and no access to the document; it talks via postMessage","Data is copied by structured cloning: dates, Map, Set and circular references work, functions and DOM elements do not"],"frames":[[{"t":"cell","id":"m","x":180.0,"y":70.0,"w":280.0,"h":40.0,"text":"script · styles · layout · paint","tone":"yellow","size":10.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"text","id":"n","x":180.0,"y":116.0,"text":"long loop = frozen UI","size":10.0}],[{"t":"cell","id":"a","x":70.0,"y":70.0,"w":100.0,"h":40.0,"text":"page","tone":"yellow","size":10.5,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"b","x":290.0,"y":70.0,"w":100.0,"h":40.0,"text":"Worker","tone":"green","size":10.5,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"line","id":"e1","x1":122.0,"y1":58.0,"x2":238.0,"y2":58.0,"tone":"blue","arrow":true,"width":1.6},{"t":"line","id":"e2","x1":238.0,"y1":84.0,"x2":122.0,"y2":84.0,"tone":"blue","arrow":true,"width":1.6}],[{"t":"cell","id":"o0","x":66.0,"y":56.0,"w":100.0,"h":28.0,"text":"Date","tone":"green","size":10.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"o1","x":180.0,"y":56.0,"w":100.0,"h":28.0,"text":"Map / Set","tone":"green","size":10.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"o2","x":294.0,"y":56.0,"w":100.0,"h":28.0,"text":"loop ↺","tone":"green","size":10.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"o3","x":66.0,"y":100.0,"w":100.0,"h":28.0,"text":"function ✕","tone":"red","size":10.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"o4","x":180.0,"y":100.0,"w":100.0,"h":28.0,"text":"DOM ✕","tone":"red","size":10.0,"sub_size":8.5}]],"cues":[10.6,18.9]}]},{"title":"Transfer and channels","sub":"transfer, MessageChannel, pool","short":"Channels","main":"Transfer a buffer instead of copying it.","body":[{"t":"scene","labels":["transfer","MessageChannel","Pool and RPC"],"captions":["A buffer in the transfer list is not copied but moves to another thread; the sender's copy becomes empty","A message channel links two ports directly; SharedWorker is shared across tabs, SharedArrayBuffer needs page isolation","Workers are wrapped in remote calls (Comlink) and kept in a thread pool instead of one thread per task"],"frames":[[{"t":"cell","id":"a","x":70.0,"y":70.0,"w":100.0,"h":40.0,"text":"buf (1 MB)","tone":"yellow","size":10.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"line","id":"e","x1":122.0,"y1":70.0,"x2":238.0,"y2":70.0,"tone":"green","arrow":true,"width":1.6},{"t":"cell","id":"b","x":290.0,"y":70.0,"w":100.0,"h":40.0,"text":"buf","tone":"green","size":10.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"text","id":"n","x":70.0,"y":106.0,"text":"byteLength: 0","size":9.0}],[{"t":"cell","id":"p1","x":80.0,"y":70.0,"w":80.0,"h":34.0,"text":"port1","tone":"blue","size":10.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"p2","x":280.0,"y":70.0,"w":80.0,"h":34.0,"text":"port2","tone":"blue","size":10.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"line","id":"e1","x1":124.0,"y1":64.0,"x2":236.0,"y2":64.0,"tone":"green","arrow":true,"width":1.6},{"t":"line","id":"e2","x1":236.0,"y1":78.0,"x2":124.0,"y2":78.0,"tone":"green","arrow":true,"width":1.6}],[{"t":"cell","id":"w0","x":66.0,"y":50.0,"w":60.0,"h":30.0,"text":"W1","tone":"green","size":10.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"w1","x":142.0,"y":50.0,"w":60.0,"h":30.0,"text":"W2","tone":"green","size":10.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"w2","x":218.0,"y":50.0,"w":60.0,"h":30.0,"text":"W3","tone":"green","size":10.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"w3","x":294.0,"y":50.0,"w":60.0,"h":30.0,"text":"W4","tone":"green","size":10.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"q","x":180.0,"y":116.0,"w":260.0,"h":26.0,"text":"task queue","tone":"yellow","size":10.0,"sub_size":8.5}]],"cues":[13.0,27.6]}]},{"title":"Service Worker","sub":"Proxy and scope","short":"SW","main":"HTTPS only, and only its own scope.","body":[{"t":"scene","labels":["Proxy","HTTPS only","Scope"],"captions":["A service worker is a script the browser runs apart from the page; it sees requests in its scope and answers from cache, network or itself","No document access, short-lived, woken by events; works only over HTTPS (except localhost)","The scope is the path the worker controls; by default it is the folder containing its script"],"frames":[[{"t":"cell","id":"p","x":50.0,"y":70.0,"w":70.0,"h":34.0,"text":"page","tone":"yellow","size":9.5,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"s","x":180.0,"y":70.0,"w":100.0,"h":40.0,"text":"Service Worker","tone":"blue","size":9.5,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"n","x":310.0,"y":70.0,"w":60.0,"h":34.0,"text":"network","tone":"green","size":10.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"line","id":"e1","x1":88.0,"y1":70.0,"x2":128.0,"y2":70.0,"tone":"green","arrow":true,"width":1.6},{"t":"line","id":"e2","x1":232.0,"y1":70.0,"x2":276.0,"y2":70.0,"tone":"green","arrow":true,"width":1.6},{"t":"cell","id":"c","x":180.0,"y":124.0,"w":90.0,"h":24.0,"text":"cache","tone":"muted","size":10.0,"sub_size":8.5}],[{"t":"code","id":"c~code","x":24.0,"y":40.0,"lines":["navigator.serviceWorker","  .register('/sw.js');"],"hl":[0,1],"lang":"js","size":11.0,"lh":26.0,"w":320.0},{"t":"text","id":"n~text","x":180.0,"y":126.0,"text":"https:// or localhost","size":10.0}],[{"t":"code","id":"c~code","x":24.0,"y":30.0,"lines":["/app/sw.js","scope: /app/","","/app/page   ✓ controlled","/other     ✕ out of scope"],"hl":[3],"lang":"js","size":10.5,"lh":22.0,"w":320.0}]],"cues":[16.1,21.5]}]},{"title":"Lifecycle","sub":"install, waiting, activate","short":"Cycle","main":"A new version waits for the old one.","body":[{"t":"scene","labels":["install","waiting","activate"],"captions":["After registration the browser downloads the script and fires install, usually to fill the cache","If the old version controls tabs, the new one waits until they close; skipWaiting and clients.claim speed this up","activate is the time to remove old caches; on each check the script is compared byte by byte, any difference is an update"],"frames":[[{"t":"cell","id":"s0","x":56.0,"y":70.0,"w":74.0,"h":32.0,"text":"in